+## An Active Project
+
+Plotto is a plot-generation project based on William Wallace Cook’s book. It has a home here alongside the other writing and tabletop tools.
+
+## Under Development
+
+The application is under development. Its current page may show unfinished features; that status describes the work in progress. This catalog entry does not claim that the generator is complete.
+
+[Visit Plotto](https://plotto.tedt.org/) to see its current state.
+
+## Explore Related Work
